:{"@type":"Contents","#text":"Introduction / by Edward Friedman and Roderick MacFarquhar -- Translators' note -- A chronology of the great famine -- An everlasting tombstone -- The epicenter of the disaster -- The three red banners : source of the famine -- Hard times in Gansu -- The people's commune : foundation of the totalitarian system -- The communal kitchens -- Hungry ghosts in heaven's pantry -- The ravages of the five winds -- Anxious in Anhui -- The food crisis -- Turnaround in Lushan -- China's population loss in the great leap forward -- The official response to the crisis -- Social stability during the great famine -- The systemic causes of the great famine -- The great famine's impact on Chinese politics -- Notes -- Bibliography -- Index."},"note":[{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"Yang Jisheng ; translated from the Chinese by Stacy Mosher and Guo Jian ; edited by Edward Friedman, Guo Jian, and Stacy Mosher ; introduction by Edward Friedman and Roderick MacFarquhar."},"Edited and condensed at time of translation. Original Chinese version published as Mu bei in 2008.",{"@type":"bibliography","#text":"Includes bibliographical references and index."}],"subject":[{"geographicCode":{"@authority":"marcgac","#text":"a-cc---"}},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":["Famines","History"],"geographic":"China","temporal":"20th century"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":["Food supply","History"],"geographic":"China","temporal":"20th century"},{"@authority":"lcsh","geographic":"China","topic":["Population","History"],"temporal":"20th century"},{"@authority":"lcsh","geographic":"China","topic":"Economic conditions","temporal":"20th century"},{"@authority":"lcsh","geographic":"China","topic":"Social conditions","temporal":"20th century"},{"@authority":"lcsh","geographic":"China","topic":"Politics and government","temporal":"20th century"},{"@authority":"fast","temporal":"1900-1999"}],"classification":[{"@authority":"lcc","#text":"HC430.F3 Y36513 2012"},{"@edition":"2